  "measurement_notes": [
    "Controlled Python child under the real session service; echo disabled; each ACK follows consumed Return input.",
    "Timing run uses OS-injected Return through cliclick, AppKit and Qt. Separate native_input evidence qualifies real Japanese IME behavior; physical key-to-photon latency is not measured.",
    "Final measurement ran after builds, workers and other GUI/CLI checks stopped.",
    "Service publish_ns is recorded before snapshot extraction. The transport interval includes extraction, serialization, IPC and GUI decoding.",
    "afterSynchronizing and frameSwapped are correlated to the matching snapshot revision. frameSwapped is a submission proxy, not measured pixel visibility.",
    "Idle period begins after history-to-live trials and includes one trailing submitted frame; frame count is not hardware GPU utilization.",
    "Latency targets remain provisional. Every measured input exceeded one 120 Hz refresh interval.",
    "History-to-live is retained-screen restoration, not cross-session switching.",
    "Timing baseline hashes are retained separately from the rebuilt qualification binaries. Production desktop/session sources are unchanged between production_source_revision and source_revision; the added native probe and its CMake target are test tooling."
  ],
  "remaining_acceptance": [],
  "limitations": [
    "Selection/copy from terminal cells and a terminal accessibility tree remain unsupported.",
    "Cross-cell contextual shaping and curly underline fidelity retain previously documented limits.",
    "Queued archive tail can be lost on forced service termination; disk pages do not restore live processes.",
    "Unknown files are preserved and not charged as archive pages; page quotas exclude bounded temporary writes and fixed metadata.",
    "Qt, MoltenVK and Ghostty dependencies are not instrumented by first-party sanitizer builds.",
    "Linux UI is deferred; no new Linux desktop support is claimed.",
    "The new CCR review worker timed out without a final verdict; no independent-review pass is claimed."
  ],
  "regressions_fixed_during_qualification": [
    "One-row archive backpressure could exceed the queue capacity. Harvesting now proceeds in bounded pieces.",
    "Qt windowChanged could call the derived terminal surface after destruction. Focus hooks now disconnect before base teardown.",
    "Native test focus restoration was asynchronous. Fresh-input checks now reacquire input ownership.",
    "Known abandoned pending files are recovered under the root lock; concurrent writers wait briefly for the shared lock."
  ],
